# Earbuds theme scope (y9yn6k-me)

## Target theme only

- **Store:** `y9yn6k-me.myshopify.com`
- **Theme ID:** `155526856773` — "Multipage Earbuds website"
- **Editor:** https://admin.shopify.com/store/y9yn6k-me/themes/155526856773/editor
- **Local root:** this repo (`Earbuds-Websites/`). Pull/push only with `shopify.theme.toml` theme `155526856773`.

Do **not** edit or push `Toy-car-multipage/` (source copy, theme `155057455173`) or any other theme folder unless the user explicitly asks.

## Unique routes (isolation from RC multipage copy)

This theme was duplicated from the toy-car multipage theme. Parent still uses `tc-mp-*-155057` view/template suffixes. **All new or changed alternate templates and internal links for earbuds work must use this theme’s own suffix**, not `155057`.

Convention:

| Piece | Value |
|--------|--------|
| Short theme token | `155526` (from theme id `155526856773`) |
| View/template prefix | `eb-mp-` (earbuds multipage) |
| Example collection view | `/collections/all?view=eb-mp-shop-155526` |
| Example template file | `templates/collection.eb-mp-shop-155526.json` |
| Example index alt | `templates/index.eb-mp-storefront-155526.json` |

Reuse existing `tc-mp-*` **sections/snippets/assets** when behavior matches; only **URL `view=` values and JSON template filenames** need the `eb-mp-*-155526` namespace for new work.

When renaming legacy `155057` routes in this theme, update every reference in this repo (JSON templates, section settings, Liquid links) and assign the new index/collection templates in the theme editor for **this theme id only**.

## Deploy

```bash
shopify theme push --environment development
# or: shopify theme push --theme 155526856773
```

Never push earbuds changes to theme `155057455173` or other theme IDs.
